# Duxport Internal Agents & Dashboards — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A **standalone Next.js admin dashboard** (`admin-dashboard/`) with:

- **8 AI Agents** powered by Groq, each querying real Supabase data
- **10 Dashboards** with real-time metrics
- **Secret key authentication** (key: `HarshNishaAnayaVivek`)

